   "announcedAt": "2025-05-22T01:12:47.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hola Metaphor fans, LATAM Spanish subtitles are now available for Metaphor: ReFantazio! We’re delighted to bring this support for our Latin American audience and hope even more players can now experience this adventure.",
